1
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:05,813
Hi everyone! I'm Soda, an Alaskan Malamute.
大家好！我是小苏打，一只阿拉斯加犬。

2
00:00:08,067 --> 00:00:10,621
I come from a very cold place,
我来自一个非常寒冷的地方，

3
00:00:11,067 --> 00:00:13,412
and I can run super fast!
而且我跑得可快啦！

4
00:00:15,733 --> 00:00:17,394
I'm so excited to meet you all.
见到大家，我特别开心。

5
00:00:19,733 --> 00:00:23,309
This is my big brother, Jacky. He's a cheerful little chick.
这是我的哥哥奇奇，他是一只开朗的小鸡。

6
00:00:26,733 --> 00:00:30,866
And this is my big sister, Angela. She's a gentle sheep.
这位是我的姐姐露露，她是一只温柔的绵羊。

7
00:00:33,733 --> 00:00:36,926
We live together happily and love each other very much.
我们快乐地生活在一起，也非常爱彼此。

8
00:00:41,733 --> 00:00:43,475
I hope you like me too!
希望你们也喜欢我！
